BCC_Q({"y": 2022, "n": 2, "part": "A", "topic": "algo", "title": "Missing Library\nBook", "answer": 3, "story": "<p>Bibako has left a book somewhere in their house. The picture below is\na map of the house. They begin searching for the book in the room marked\nSTART. Each of the other rooms is marked with a picture.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"A description of the map can be found at the end of the Story.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80.0%\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Bibako moves around the house from room to room until they find the\nbook. Their movements, in order, are represented by the sequence of\narrows below. Each arrow represents a move from Bibako’s current\nlocation to an adjacent room indicated by the direction of the\narrow.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"Each arrow points either up, down, left or right. The sequence of arrows is as follows: down, left, left, right, up, up, right, down, right, right.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80.0%\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<button onclick=\"hideSeek('longdesc1')\" style=\"box-shadow: none;\">Hide/Reveal Description of Map<\/button>\n<div id=\"longdesc1\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<p>There are 12 rooms in the house. Each of the rooms (each identified\nby a picture), along with all possible moves from that room, is given in\nthe following table.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"header\">\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Room<\/th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Possible moves<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">START<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to Circle; Right to Triangle; Down to\nArc; Left to Hourglass<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Circle<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Right to Heart; Down to START; Left to\nDiamond<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Triangle<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to Heart; Right to Lightning; Down to\nRectangle; Left to START<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Arc<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to START; Right to Rectangle; Left to\nCross<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Hourglass<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to Diamond; Right to START; Down to\nCross<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Diamond<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Right to Circle; Down to Hourglass<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Heart<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Right to Sun; Down to Triangle; Left to\nCircle<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Rectangle<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to Triangle; Left to Arc<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Cross<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to Hourglass; Right to Arc; Left to\nStop Sign<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Sun<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Down to Lightning; Left to Heart<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Lightning<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Up to Sun; Left to Triangle<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Stop Sign<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Right to Cross<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<hr class=\"longdesc\"/><\/div>", "question": "<p>Which picture corresponds to the room where the book is found?<\/p>\n<ol class=\"mc\">\n<li> <img alt=\"heart\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px;\"/> <\/li>\n<li> <img alt=\"triangle\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px;\"/> <\/li>\n<li> <img alt=\"sun\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px;\"/> <\/li>\n<li> <img alt=\"lightning\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px;\"/> <\/li>\n<\/ol>", "answerHtml": "<p>(D) <img alt=\"lightning\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px;\"/><\/p>", "explanation": "<p>The picture below shows Bibako’s movements.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"Down to arc, left to cross, left to stop sign, right to cross, up to hourglass, up to diamond, right to circle, down to START, right to triangle, right to lightning.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80.0%\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>A lightning bolt marks the room where Bibako ends and finds the\nbook.<\/p>", "connections": "<p>Each arrow in this task indicates what position to move to next, and\nthe sequence of all arrows can be thought of as the <em>algorithm<\/em>\nthat is to be followed. An algorithm is a sequence of operations, and\nthis task is concerned with <em>tracing<\/em> that algorithm: that is,\nremembering the <em>state<\/em>, which in this task is the position that\nBibako is in after each step. The ability to trace a program and\nunderstand what the state is after each step is a crucial skill in\ncomputer science, since it allows program developers to reason about\ntheir program before it is fully implemented and executed.<\/p>", "mc": 1});